  "description": {
   "en": "MMA world champion Kim Jin-ho has awoken in the wold of Last Saver, as the wizard Zed Arahan.\n\nIn this other world, knights are close range and wizards are long range. However, it seem like Zed doesn't have any magic power?!\n\nA genius who breaks the immutable law has appeared!",
   "ko": "격투기 세계 챔피언 '김진호', 마법사 '제드 아라한'의 몸으로 깨어나다!\n\n기사는 근거리, 마법사는 원거리. 불변의 법칙을 깨는 천재가 나타났다!"
  },
